.TH SWAYDESK-WEATHER-POPUP 1 2026-11-14 "swaydesk 0.2.1" "Sway desktop components"
.SH NAME
swaydesk\-weather\-popup \- weather popup for Waybar
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B swaydesk\-weather\-popup
.SH DESCRIPTION
The weather now, the next hours and the next three days, from wttr.in, centered under the bar. It reads the same cache as swaydesk\-weather, so it opens at once and shows the same numbers.
.PP
Running it again while the popup is open closes it, and opening it closes the other popups of the bar. Esc, clicking outside or switching workspace also closes it.
.PP
The session runs it under the name waybar\-weather (a link in the package's helper directory to /usr/bin/swaydesk\-weather\-popup); the process name is waybar\-weather too.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-check
Exit 0 at once without doing anything: the Python launchers use it to check that the binary and its libraries load.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/swaydesk/config.toml
The desktop configuration: language, accent color, GTK and icon themes, folder color, file manager, weather location and holidays.
.TP
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/waybar\-weather.json
The cached forecast shared with swaydesk\-weather.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR swaydesk (7),
.BR swaydesk\-weather (1)
